the demon king has loomed large over the  story of the seven deadly sins for a  very long time he is the father of  meliora sans el dress he is the ruler of  the entire demon clan and his power  reaches divine levels but just as  interesting as the demon Kings power are  his true thoughts feelings and  motivations why does the demon king do  all of the terrible things that he has  done and why does he treat even his own  sons with such condescension and  contempt I am Anna Mac for anime uproar  and in this video we are going to take a  deep dive into the psyche of the demon  king in order to understand what makes  him tick what motivates him to do the  evil things that he has done and what  his psychological profile tells us about  what to expect from him in the future I  hope to make this type of video into a  series in which I explore the psychology  of other mysterious and ominous anime  characters so if that's something that  you want to see the best way to let me  know is to like the video and share it  with anyone who might be interested also  to subscribe to the channel and hit that  notification bell and to show your  support down in the comments feel free  to let me know which other fictional  characters and their psychological  profiles you would like me to examine in  the future now in order to fully  understand the mind of the demon king I  will have to analyze all the available  information up to this point including  information from the manga with that  said this video will contain manga  spoilers so please proceed with caution  if we were to build a criminal profile  of the demon king we would have to  classify him as a highly organized and  intelligent offender as far as we know  he is the oldest known creature in the  seven deadly sins especially if we take  the time he spent in purgatory into  consideration and some of the plans that  the demon king has set in motion took  thousands of years to come to fruition  this tells us that the demon king is  extremely cunning a meticulous planner  and both patient  and determined the demon king is able to  predict the behavior of others and  manipulate them using both his  intelligence and his incredible magical  abilities we know how powerful the demon  king is for a long time we've been told  that he and the supreme deity are the  two most powerful creatures in that  entire magical world and we've even seen  the demon Kings opie abilities in action  if you want to know more about the demon  Kings power you can check out our video  called how strong is the demon king I  will link it in the description so feel  free to watch that right after this but  what about the demon king psychology why  does he do the things that he has done  as we have seen for the demon king  loyalty is paramount there is nothing  that he hates more than weakness and  disloyalty and as the ruler of the demon  clan he cannot understand why anyone  would betray the interests of the demon  clan as a whole because of some personal  feelings or connections the demon king  is even prepared to severely punish his  own sons when he believes they are  acting out of weakness and disloyalty  and it wouldn't be hard to argue that  the curse which the demon king has  placed on his eldest son meliodas  is a fate worse than death meliodas was  cursed so that he cannot die and so he  must relive the pain of losing the woman  he loves over and over again for  thousands of years but this hate that  the demon king feels about the very idea  of betrayal actually reveals a lot about  his personality clearly the demon king  has serious trust issues he doesn't  trust anyone and he values power and  control above all other things  the reason he values power and control  is likely because being completely in  control reduces the chances of someone  betraying you or stabbing you in the  back we know that in the past the demon  king has been betrayed first the  original demon betrayed him the demon  king used a large portion of his own  power to create the original demon and  the idea was that the original demon  would help the demon king rule over the  tumultuous demon realm a more  effectively however the original demon  betrayed the demon king and attempted to  overthrow him ultimately the original  demons rebellion failed and the demon  king punished him by splitting him up  into two death  beings and then tasking those beings  with training the demon Kings two sons  but there is a lot more to this than  merely summarizing the events very  briefly as I just did the demon king  would have been affected psychologically  by this betrayal the original demon of  being that he himself created and a  being that he trusted stabbed the demon  king in the back and nearly overthrew  him this type of traumatic event would  definitely make you think twice about  trusting someone again especially when  you are the ruler of an entire clan and  you possess the kind of power that  others would certainly want to take for  themselves if they could and after this  came the betrayal of Mele Otis his  eldest son and heir to the throne as the  ruler of the demon clan the demon king  has to put the interests of the clan as  a whole or at least what he believes to  be the interest of the clan as a whole  ahead of personal interests of  individuals the demons and the other  clans and especially the goddess clan  had been at war for a very long time and  as evil as the demon king appears to us  right now we have to remember that the  goddess clan teaches its members from a  very young age that all demons are  impure and vile creatures and that they  all need to be exterminated so it's not  like the goddesses want peace and the  demon king wants to destroy them the  goddesses are a real and serious threat  to the very existence of the demon clan  the demon king saw his oldest son  meliodas as his heir meliodas was known  as a ruthless and loyal demon Prince and  he had unrivaled potential as such  meliodas was the obvious choice for the  next demon king the one who would  destroy the enemies of the demons before  those enemies could destroy them however  Mele Otis ultimately fell in love with  Elizabeth a member of the goddess clan  and because he no longer supported the  holy war he betrayed the demon clan and  abandoned the ten commandments the elite  demon fighting force of which he was a  part it is believed that Mele Otis even  killed the two members of the  commandments during his betrayal and  this represents the second time that the  demon king had someone close to him  betray him and stab him in the back  first the original demon of being he  created and then his own son his heir  apparent it isn't hard to see how these  two betrayals and perhaps  other portrayals that we don't even know  about would lead the demon king to  having severe trust issues in fact the  demon king hates being deceived so much  that he destroyed the entire city of  beli Alwyn together with the supreme  deity after the two of them had been  deceived by Merlin we can assume that  because he was deceived and betrayed so  many times including by people closest  to him the demon king has come to see  all emotions and especially the emotion  of love as a weakness you can only be  betrayed by someone close to you if you  allow someone to be close to you in the  first place and so the demon king likely  concluded that being attached to anyone  including his own sons is a weakness the  demon king most likely concluded that if  he simply lets go of all of his emotions  all personal attachments and all ideas  of trust and love he could protect  himself from ever being betrayed again  this is one of the reasons why the demon  king behaves so ruthlessly and why he  taunts malleolus and celtris about the  fact that their love for Elizabeth and  gelda affect their judgment his loathing  for Elizabeth in particular really comes  out once he takes possession of  melioidosis body and confronts her face  to face he even says that he will remove  her curse just so he can brutally kill  her and this is because for the demon  king elizabeth is the very embodiment of  his son's weakness and of his son's  betrayal there may also be some other  factors at play here perhaps the demon  king was also betrayed by a woman at  some point maybe even the supreme deity  and that is why he has a special dislike  for Elizabeth and for her relationship  with meliodas but that is all just  speculation at this time but there is  one other important factor that we have  to consider in order to get a more  complete picture of the demon Kings mind  the fact that the demon king is a king a  ruler complicates his state of mind and  motivations because the duties and  responsibilities of a ruler are  different than those of an ordinary  person the demon king is believed to be  the first king of the demon clan and  assuming that this is indeed the case at  some point the demon king would have had  to have taken control of the chaotic  demon realm and bring order to it he  would have had to not only unite the  entire demon realm which is home to some  incredibly powerful creatures but at the  same time he would also have had to deal  with external  threats like potential attacks by the  goddess clan so the demon king isn't  only worried about his personal  relationships and family ties he has to  also worry about gaining control of the  demon realm and crushing all internal  threats while also dealing with serious  external threats posed by rival clans we  already know that during this process  the demon king was betrayed by people he  trusted including the original demon and  so no matter what we think of the demon  king now we have to assume that he went  through a lot of hardship before he got  to where he is today including the types  of hardship that an ordinary person who  doesn't have responsibility of ruling  over others will never have to worry  about looking at some real world  examples from our own history can help  shed light on how the demon king became  who he is today  Qin Shi Huangdi the first emperor of  China and Tokugawa Ieyasu the founder of  the Tokugawa Shogunate in Japan are good  examples of real world rulers who had to  become ruthless in order to bring order  to a chaotic realm China before the rise  of the first emperor and Japan before  the Tokugawa Shogunate were extremely  divided realms where smaller warring  States and warlords were constantly  struggling for supremacy violence  suffering and death were daily  occurrences for centuries and  potentially hundreds of thousands of  innocent people were killed as a result  of the constant warfare although it is  impossible to know the true number of  casualties if you've seen the anime door  or oh then you will have some idea of  what Japan was like in the period before  the Tokugawa Shogunate was formed the  first emperor of China and the founder  of the Tokugawa Shogunate eventually  brought peace to their realms by  unifying the warring States and kingdoms  into one large realm under a single  ruler but they didn't achieve this  through rational arguments or trust and  kindness they succeeded because they  ruthlessly destroyed all rival factions  and eliminated all potential rivals  through the throne they achieved a noble  end they stopped the wars and the  suffering of so many people but they did  it by ruthlessly destroying all of their  enemies and we have to assume that the  demon king had to go through a similar  power struggle the demon realm which we  know was chaotic and unruly was likely  subjugated by the demon king and his  forces through some very brutal mean  and this power struggle likely played an  important role in shaping the demon  Kings personality he knows from  experience that you have to be ruthless  in order to bring order to chaos  he knows that you might have to face  betrayal along the way even from those  closest to you and he has shaped his  personality accordingly this doesn't  mean that we should support or excuse  the demon Kings behavior but all of this  does help us understand where he is  coming from and how he came to be who he  is today we've all heard the expression  it's lonely at the top as the ruler of  the demon clan the demon king is at the  top but with power comes betrayal and as  someone who has been betrayed multiple  times the demon king appears to be  incapable of trusting anyone and is even  somewhat paranoid in recent chapters we  learned that the demon king has been  using the power of the commandments to  keep track of all the commandments and  their actions and intentions and of  course we know that the demon king has  been using hawk and other creatures to  spy on meliodas for a long time even the  names of some of the demon Kings  recently revealed special abilities the  sighing sage and the Hermit of moments  seemed to allude to his profound  loneliness and seeing us how much time  he has spent in purgatory it makes sense  that the demon king would be extremely  lonely being a ruler who has to be  ruthless and who cannot trust anyone not  even those closest to him would make  anyone profoundly lonely and this  loneliness explains why the demon king  doesn't seem capable of empathizing with  anyone why he rejects all emotions as  weakness and why he mocks everyone who  doesn't look at the world in the same  way that he does finally the demon king  may actually resent his eldest son  meliodas because he may have an  inferiority complex in relation to his  son in more recent chapters we learned  that meliodas has an immense original  power a power so great that he has been  afraid to use it and a power that once  activated ensures that meliodas can no  longer remain in the mortal plane for  more than one day the demon king calls  this power the source of destruction and  it is possible that the demon king is  also afraid of melioidosis power and  potential after all the demon king is  the rule  the one who brought about order from  chaos at least within the demon clan and  I believe that the demon king fears  melioidosis immense potential to become  the destroyer their source of  destruction that brings an end to the  order that the demon king worked so hard  to build so while we can all agree that  the demon king is a villain and someone  who does bad things to innocent people  it is always important to try to  understand a character and where they  are coming from including villains a  good villain isn't evil for the sake of  being evil something made him the way he  is something drives him and his actions  when we examined the life of the demon  king we realized that he had to become  ruthless in order to bring order to  chaos inside the demon realm we realized  that he faced multiple betrayals by  people closest to him which led him to  reject trust and love while making him  lonely and paranoid and we realized that  the relationship between the demon king  and meliodas is a complex one because  Mele Otis's original power has the  potential to destroy everything that the  demon King worked all of his life to  build and I love how all of these  factors come together perfectly  in the epic showdown between the demon  king and meliodas in the seven deadly  sins manga I can't wait to see what  happens next and I really hope that you  enjoyed this journey inside the mind of  the demon king I hope that I've been  able to shed some light on his  personality and motivations and if this  video helped you get a better  understanding of the demon Kings  character you can leave a like to let me  know and you could subscribe for more  videos like this one if you want me to  make this into a series which explores  the mind of other anime characters you  can let me know by sharing this video  and giving me suggestions for which  characters to cover in the comments down  below if you feel that videos like this  one provide value for you and you want  to support more you can check out our  patreon we recently revamped the whole  thing a big thank you to all of the  patrons supporting us right now  including our pro hero tier patrons the  one and only Gilgamesh and keelon and  also are the one to your patrons the  ones who stand above all clans including  a seventeen FF DP lil lady KD and  daddy Mac 239 even donating a single  dollar will give you access to our  special patron only discord and you will  see your name appear in our videos so  please if you're interested check us out  link in the description as always thank  you guys so much for watching it means a  lot to me and until next time see us  bass cowboys  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

